{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S11等较短时段连续铺开大量感受词，纵向扫读的负担明显高于Y左右分栏的快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更方便快速浏览，但右侧短词往往是并列标签，需要观众自己拼接。X用加亮短语突出每段叙事支点，又把感受与音乐具体节点对应起来，人物从离开后的失落、反复怀念和挣扎，到最终带着想念继续生活的变化更容易被理解。尤其X对节奏、音区、音型、身体反应和情绪转折的描写更细腻具体，不只是告诉观众悲伤或高兴，而是让人感受到情绪如何发生、变化和消退。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8baecd8e-8a80-4bd3-abcd-dcfb45da60ac", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230939976716Z", "elapsed_seconds": 118.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:11:38.287715+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55ec533d00996ee2e37b4a1414fb3944e2bb81cc850d306629f7f324d8f8d091", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme